{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":1,"title":"하나 건너 하나","desc":"<p>리스트에서 <b>0번째, 2번째, 4번째…</b> 원소만 모은 리스트를 돌려주는 <code>every_other(nums)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def every_other(nums):\n    pass\n","solution":"def every_other(nums):\n    return nums[::2]\n","hint":"<p>슬라이싱 <code>nums[::2]</code>는 2칸씩 건너뛰어요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"every_other([1, 2, 3, 4, 5])","expected":[1,3,5],"visible":true},{"call":"every_other([])","expected":[],"visible":true},{"call":"every_other([9])","expected":[9],"visible":false},{"call":"every_other([1, 2])","expected":[1],"visible":false}],"id":"py-059"}